  "paragraphs": [
   "Benchmark Analytics sells evidence-based personnel management software designed for public safety. The line-up is offered in partnership with the University of Chicago and is grounded in research and powered by data science.",
   "The Benchmark Management System is described as a single-source platform for all compliance and people data. First Sign, the Officer Advocacy Suite, is presented as a full-suite resource for officer wellness, support, and success. The Case Action Response Engine covers proactive management of assigned interventions.",
   "Stated uses of the analytics include identifying potentially problematic behavior. Another stated use is determining which officers are at risk of leaving the agency."
